    <node id="PREEMACS">
      <data key="d0">PREEMACS</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A software tool that includes the M1 module and is run using Apptainer with a preemacs.sif image.&lt;SEP&gt;A software pipeline that processes T1 and T2 input images and produces output in a specified directory. The code is located at commit c57835c0223104072c4f4e2947a253f1826a27e0.&lt;SEP&gt;A software project or pipeline whose code is referenced at commit c57835c0223104072c4f4e2947a253f1826a27e0, specifically the run_full_pipeline.sh script.</data>
      <data key="d3">NHP_M1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;WRAPPER_LICENSE-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;WRAPPER_BINDS-chunk-000</data>
