    <node id="Longitudinal Processing">
      <data key="d0">Longitudinal Processing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A FreeSurfer processing approach that involves cross-sectional processing of time points, creation of an unbiased template, and longitudinal processing of each time point.&lt;SEP&gt;A processing scheme coded in the recon-all script via the '-long' flag, which processes all timepoints of a subject and produces output data with names containing '&lt;tpNid&gt;.long.&lt;templateid&gt;'.</data>
