      <data key="d0">FreeSurfer</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">An open-source software suite for processing and analyzing brain MRI images, referenced in the documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;A software package for the analysis and visualization of structural and functional neuroimaging data, developed at the Martinos Center for Biomedical Imaging. The documentation describes its longitudinal processing stream.</data>
